      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谷野美酒让我明白\n她评估自己比我想像得\n更加“快速”、严格且正确。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2db247e87b389a425bd57f35dcf25bf3327185c360f00c32dcab23aa62477175",
