      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我确实需要实战经验。\n就像战士要在战场上磨练本事一样，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "29353284a5e5b9d9e6efae598e44c43983b980a6a5fe8e4dacbed16dcd5e7b4c",
